{"code":"tr-TR","name":"Turkish","native":"Türkçe","badge":"TR","tts":"tr-TR","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Anlamadım.","say":"an-la-MA-dum","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"lit":"I didn’t understand"},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Bilmiyorum.","say":"bil-MEE-yo-rum","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Bir dakika, lütfen.","say":"beer da-kee-KA, LÜT-fen","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Tekrar eder misiniz?","say":"tek-RAR eh-DEHR mee-see-neez","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Daha yavaş, lütfen.","say":"da-HA ya-VASH, LÜT-fen","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Türkçe “…” nasıl denir?","say":"TÜRK-cheh … NA-sul deh-NEER","en":"How do you say “…” in Turkish?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Tabii.","say":"ta-BEE","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Aynen.","say":"AI-nen","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree","hook":"Aynen ≈ “I’m in”: total agreement."},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Sanırım.","say":"sa-NU-rum","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Gerçekten mi?","say":"gehr-CHEK-ten mee","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"Sorun değil.","say":"so-RUN deh-EEL","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Harika!","say":"HA-ree-ka","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"{x} nerede?","say":"{x} NEH-reh-deh","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"{x:acc} istiyorum.","say":"{x:acc} ees-TEE-yo-rum","en":"I want {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"{x} var mı?","say":"{x} VAR mu","en":"Is there {x}? / Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x:acc}, lütfen.","say":"{x:acc}, LÜT-fen","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Gitmem lazım.","say":"git-MEM la-ZUM","en":"I have to go.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Girebilir miyim?","say":"gee-reh-bee-LEER mee-yeem","en":"Can I come in?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Kontrol edeyim.","say":"kon-TROL eh-DEH-yeem","en":"Let me check.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Toplantım var.","say":"top-LAN-tum var","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Acı mı?","say":"a-JU mu","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Soğansız, lütfen.","say":"so-AN-suz, LÜT-fen","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Ne önerirsiniz?","say":"neh ö-neh-REER-see-neez","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Et yemiyorum.","say":"et yeh-MEE-yo-rum","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Ne kadar?","say":"neh ka-DAR","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Sadece bakıyorum.","say":"SA-deh-jeh ba-KU-yo-rum","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Bunu alıyorum.","say":"BU-nu a-LU-yo-rum","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Kartla ödeyebilir miyim?","say":"KART-la ö-deh-yeh-bee-LEER mee-yeem","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Uzak mı?","say":"u-ZAK mu","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"Havalimanına, lütfen.","say":"ha-va-lee-ma-nu-NA, LÜT-fen","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"sol · sağ · düz","say":"sol · saa · düz","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"İmdat!","say":"eem-DAT","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Tuvalet kâğıdı yok.","say":"tu-va-LET kyaa-u-DU yok","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Kendimi iyi hissetmiyorum.","say":"ken-dee-MEE ee-YEE hees-set-MEE-yo-rum","en":"I don’t feel well.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Lütfen ambulans çağırın.","say":"LÜT-fen am-bu-LANS cha-U-run","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Memnun oldum.","say":"mem-NUN ol-DUM","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Nerelisiniz?","say":"neh-reh-LEE-see-neez","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Ne iş yapıyorsunuz?","say":"neh EESH ya-PU-yor-su-nuz","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Çok lezzetli!","say":"chok lez-zet-LEE","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Merhaba.","say":"MEHR-ha-ba","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Günaydın.","say":"gün-ai-DUN","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Nasılsınız?","say":"NA-sul-su-nuz","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Evet. · Hayır.","say":"eh-VET · HA-yur","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Lütfen.","say":"LÜT-fen","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Teşekkürler.","say":"teh-shek-kür-LEHR","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Pardon.","say":"par-DON","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Hoşça kalın.","say":"HOSH-cha ka-LUN","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"bir · iki · üç","say":"beer · ee-KEE · üch","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"dört · beş · altı","say":"dört · besh · al-TU","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"yedi · sekiz · dokuz","say":"yeh-DEE · seh-KEEZ · do-KUZ","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"on · yirmi · yüz","say":"on · yeer-MEE · yüz","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Elma kırmızı.","say":"el-MA kur-mu-ZU","en":"The apple is red.","note":"no “is” and no “the”"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Elmayı yiyorum.","say":"el-ma-YU YEE-yo-rum","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"verb last · -ı marks “the” object · -um = I"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Elmayı yedim.","say":"el-ma-YU yeh-DEEM","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"-di = past, -m = I"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Elmayı yemek istiyorum.","say":"el-ma-YU yeh-MEK ees-TEE-yo-rum","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"infinitive (-mek) + istiyorum"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Elma yer misin?","say":"el-MA yehr mee-SEEN","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"mi after the verb makes a question"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"tuvalet","say":"tu-va-LET","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"eczane","say":"ej-za-NEH","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"hastane","say":"has-ta-NEH","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"istasyon","say":"ees-tas-YON","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"havalimanı","say":"ha-va-lee-ma-NU","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"otel","say":"o-TEL","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"su","say":"su","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"bir kahve","say":"beer kah-VEH","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"hesap","say":"heh-SAP","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"menü","say":"meh-NÜ","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"bir bira","say":"beer BEE-ra","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"bu","say":"bu","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one","acc":"bunu","accSay":"BU-nu"},{"id":"bag","t":"poşet","say":"po-SHET","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"toplantı","say":"top-lan-TU","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"dosya","say":"dos-YA","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"ekran","say":"ek-RAN","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"mesaj","say":"meh-SAJ","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"yarın","say":"YA-run","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"}],"diet":{"title":"Alerji · lütfen okuyun","ask":"Bu yemekte bunlardan biri var mı?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Çok teşekkürler!","note":"“Fıstık” alone can mean pistachio. For peanut, say “yer fıstığı”.","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Ciddi yer fıstığı alerjim var. Yer fıstığı ve yer fıstığı yağı yiyemem.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Ciddi deniz ürünleri alerjim var (karides, yengeç, midye).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Gluten yiyemem (buğday, arpa, çavdar).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Et, tavuk ve balık yemiyorum.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Domuz eti yemiyorum.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"TUVALET · WC","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"BAY · BAYAN","en":"Bay = men, Bayan = women","warn":true},{"t":"ÇIKIŞ · GİRİŞ","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"İTİNİZ · ÇEKİNİZ","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"ACİL ÇIKIŞ","en":"Emergency exit"}]}